{
  "_comment": "Registry of apps and products for payments.3m4.net. Mirrored into the DB by `python -m dbcore.cli sync-catalog`; prices are resolved in Stripe by lookup_key (`cli create-prices` creates missing ones). Amounts are minor units. Adding an app = one entry here + `cli app-key <slug>` for its service key / webhook secret. `icon` is an absolute PNG URL (served by payments itself from apps/web/public/icons, generated from each app's favicon.svg) shown on the portal pages and on Stripe Checkout. `treat` (coffee|beer) picks the portal's wording for donations (\"Buy me a coffee\" vs \"Buy me a beer\").",
